{"title": "Scroll of Disintegrate", "pageid": 16459, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Scroll_of_Disintegrate", "categories": ["Scrolls", "Very rare items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-veryrare\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Scroll_of_Disintegrate_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Scroll_of_Disintegrate_Faded.png/300px-Scroll_of_Disintegrate_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/7/7a/Scroll_of_Disintegrate_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Scroll of Disintegrate image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Scroll_of_Disintegrate_Faded.png/300px-Scroll_of_Disintegrate_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/Scroll_of_Disintegrate_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>A <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Scroll of Disintegrate</span></a> is a single-use <a href=\"/wiki/Scrolls\" title=\"Scrolls\">scroll</a>. It allows the user to cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disintegrate\" title=\"Disintegrate\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Disintegrate_Icon.webp/20px-Disintegrate_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Disintegrate_Icon.webp/30px-Disintegrate_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Disintegrate_Icon.webp/40px-Disintegrate_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disintegrate\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Disintegrate_Icon.webp/20px-Disintegrate_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/Disintegrate_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disintegrate\" title=\"Disintegrate\">Disintegrate</a> as an <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a>.\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scrolls\" title=\"Scrolls\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Scrolls_Icon.png/24px-Scrolls_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Scrolls_Icon.png/37px-Scrolls_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Scrolls_Icon.png/49px-Scrolls_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Scrolls\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Scrolls_Icon.png/24px-Scrolls_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Scrolls_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scrolls\" title=\"Scrolls\">Scrolls</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/38px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Single Use\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Single Use</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Very rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Very rare</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.02 kg (0.04 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.02 kg (0.04 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-i